  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixeldreamstudios.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Header.webp\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p>在開發這個模組包的過程中，我使用了BisectHosting伺服器來測試多人模式的相容性和效能。設定過程快速，伺服器也能流暢運行此模組包，沒有任何問題。</p><p>如果你正想尋找一個主機來和朋友一起遊玩這個模組包，我推薦BisectHosting。</p><p>結帳時使用優惠碼 <strong>PIXELDREAM</strong>，即可享有<strong>首次遊戲伺服器25%折扣</strong>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fPixelDream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Description.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>我們的目標是在Minecraft中融入<strong>豐富的奇幻主題內容</strong>，同時保持原汁原味的<strong>原版體驗</strong>。此模組包經過最佳化，借助多種<strong>效能模組</strong>，確保在不同電腦系統上都能<strong>流暢運行</strong>。此外，我們盡心協調所有模組的配置，以達到<strong>無縫整合</strong>。如果你恰巧和我們一樣喜歡奇幻作品，一定會喜歡模組包中散落各處、致敬熱門奇幻電影與遊戲的<strong>巧妙彩蛋與隱藏驚喜</strong>。更多資訊，歡迎查閱<strong>Wiki</strong>。</p><p>想了解所有可用職業，請觀看由社群成員製作的<a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLN0QC7Gx4uK72neKTJ_thPLktglRi6ZBU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此系列影片</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.pixeldreamstudios.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Showcase.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F5G55CZCfHg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rBNGyzgVBn4\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RPS5MvvUYr8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XJX0DIUfJ4s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aMsSDkVxkOI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IH47uKX5P_Y\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/k5UmBiYw-LY?si=iCWB9sAfbWDjhm0C\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/U2Upz1ixTTo?si=YC5dxo9d9rs2Tz8h\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MxQLjwVJIGs?si=0PWTzJ6mQ1JnfXO3\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
